{"id":26897,"author":"Walt","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003ci\u003eTHIS IS THE LAST MAP TESTING EVENT UNTIL AFTER THE TOURNAMENT IS ANNOUNCED. ALL FEEDBACK IS NEEDED.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003eAfter the first two events we are already working to fix any issues/bugs that were found. We're going to test the same maps and hopefully get more teams, if you have maps that you think should be tested please pm me on discord (listed below).\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWe want as many teams to participate as possible so please message me on Discord (Roberto#7169) or Skype (swagishighyouislow) with a good time for your team to scrim.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWe have planned the possible map testing event on\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eSaturday, the 25th of March, @ 4pm EST.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWe may host another one once the tournament is announced just to make sure everything is in tip top shape.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(